# TEACH Ticket System — environment variable reference
#
# Phase 1 (application scaffold) has no required runtime secrets and no
# external-service configuration. This file exists to establish the pattern
# future phases must follow, not to declare any variables yet.
#
# Rules for every future phase:
# - Document new variables here using their NAME and a safe placeholder only
#   (e.g. EXAMPLE_VARIABLE=replace-with-your-value) — never a real value.
# - Real values belong in a local, git-ignored environment file (e.g. .env,
#   .env.local) or in managed deployment secrets — never in this file and
#   never committed to source control.
# - Real credentials, tokens, keys, or connection strings must never be
#   committed to this repository under any filename.
